## Troubleshooting

| Problem | Fix |
|--------|-----|
| Blank page on GitHub Pages | Confirm Pages source is **GitHub Actions**; check Actions log for build errors. |
| 404 on refresh / deep link | Re-run build (script copies `404.html`); redeploy. |
| Wrong paths / missing files | Rebuild with `--base-href "/dyd2026/"` (default in `build_web.ps1`). |
| “Add to Home Screen” missing | Use Safari, not in-app browsers (Messenger, FB, etc.). |
| Icons look generic | Run `dart run flutter_launcher_icons` (included in `build_web.ps1`). |

Diagnostics on PC:

```powershell
$env:Path = "C:\flutter\bin;$env:Path"
flutter doctor -v
flutter build web --release --base-href "/dyd2026/"
```

