## Native iOS app (later, optional)

If you later get a **Mac + Xcode + Apple Developer** account, you can ship a true App Store / TestFlight build with `flutter build ios`. Until then, the PWA path above is the standard way to run DYD 2026 on iPhone without a Mac.
